[[Category:Timeline]]

{{YFHR|127}}

==Events==

* The [[Factol's Manifesto]] is published by an [[Akin|unnamed editor]]. The incredibly in-depth look into the operations and secrets of [[Sigil]]'s [[faction]]s means it's almost immediately banned as a publication.<ref name="fm2-3">{{b|Planescape|The Factol's Manifesto|pdf=17275|page=2-3}}</ref>
* [[Mercykillers]] Factol [[Mallin]] dies in mysterious circumstances, replaced by the new Factol [[Alisohn Nilesia]].<ref name="fm5">{{b|Planescape|The Factol's Manifesto|pdf=17275|nip=1|page=5}}</ref><ref name="fm87">{{b|Planescape|The Factol's Manifesto|pdf=17275|nip=1|page=87}}</ref><ref name="fm100">{{b|Planescape|The Factol's Manifesto|pdf=17275|nip=1|page=100}}</ref>
* The [[Xaositects]] paint a mural on an exterior wall of the [[Great Gymnasium]]. It's widely considered one of the most beautiful works of art in the planes.<ref name="fm152">{{b|Planescape|The Factol's Manifesto|pdf=17275|page=152}}</ref>

== Background Information ==
* Given in-universe time seems to advance at the same rate as the real world, these products released in 1995 are assumed to be set during this period:
** {{b|Planescape|Planes of Law|pdf=17272|nip=1}}
** {{b|Planescape|Fires of Dis|pdf=17273}}
** {{b|Planescape|A Player's Primer to the Outlands|pdf=17301}}
** {{b|Planescape|In the Cage: A Guide to Sigil|pdf=17274|nip=1}}<ref name="itc12">{{b|Planescape|In the Cage: A Guide to Sigil|pdf=17274|page=12}}</ref>
** {{b|Planescape|The Factol's Manifesto|pdf=17275|nip=1}}<ref name="fm71">{{b|Planescape|The Factol's Manifesto|pdf=17275|page=71}}</ref><ref name="fm75">{{b|Planescape|The Factol's Manifesto|pdf=17275|page=75}}</ref>
** {{b|Planescape|Harbinger House (book)|alt=Harbinger House|pdf=17277}}
** {{b|Planescape|Planescape Monstrous Compendium Appendix II}}
** {{b|Planescape|Planes of Conflict|pdf=17278|nip=1}}

* [[Strahan's Diary]] in ''Planescape: Torment'' notes the date as the 127th Year of Factol Hashkar's Reign, but this conflicts with other dating information which suggests [[125 YFHR]].


